# 15. ARCHITECTURE

Start with a:

# MODULAR MONOLITH

Do not build premature microservices.

The system must have strict domain boundaries.

Future service extraction should be possible when justified by:

* scale
* team boundaries
* security
* regulatory requirements
* deployment independence
* workload characteristics

The architecture should evolve:

```text
Modular Monolith
      ↓
Horizontally Scaled Monolith
      ↓
Dedicated Workers
      ↓
Specialized Services
      ↓
Selective Service Extraction
```

Do not distribute the system unnecessarily.

